Subject: [PATCH] hwmon: (nct6775) add ROG Ally (RC71L) to the ASUS board list

NazoOS: from Nobara's ROG-ALLY-NCT6775-PLATFORM.patch
(Nobara-Project/rpm-sources 93742e4b, baseos/kernel/mainline/7.2), which
has no header. Context refreshed for Kernel:stable 7.2.9 (ProArt
X870E-CREATOR WIFI was added above). Lets nct6775 reach the Super I/O of
the ROG Ally through the ASUS WMI method: fan and sensor readings.
---
diff --git a/drivers/hwmon/nct6775-platform.c b/drivers/hwmon/nct6775-platform.c
--- a/drivers/hwmon/nct6775-platform.c
+++ b/drivers/hwmon/nct6775-platform.c
@@ -1370,6 +1370,7 @@ static const char * const asus_msi_boards[] = {
 	"ProArt X870E-CREATOR WIFI",
 	"ProArt Z690-CREATOR WIFI",
 	"ProArt Z790-CREATOR WIFI",
+	"RC71L",
 	"ROG CROSSHAIR X670E EXTREME",
 	"ROG CROSSHAIR X670E GENE",
 	"ROG CROSSHAIR X670E HERO",
